.TH "jags\-4" "1" "" "Version 1.0" "JAGS Utilities User Manuals"
.SH NAME
jags\-4 \- launch JAGS 4.x
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]jags\-4\f[R] [\-b=\f[I]BUILD\f[R]] [\f[I]JAGS
options/arguments\f[R]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\f[B]jags\-4\f[R] is a command\-line utility that can be used to launch
a specific version/build of JAGS version 4.x
(https://mcmc\-jags.sourceforge.io) created by the official JAGS 4.x
installer for macOS released in August 2026 (or later), without having
to run jags\-version first.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\f[B]\-b=BUILD\f[R]
An optional target build/version (otherwise the current\-4 version will
be used)
.PP
All other options and arguments will be passed directly to JAGS.
.SH SEE ALSO
http://mcmc\-jags.sourceforge.net and
https://github.com/mdenwood/JAGS\-build\-macOS
